Error [E0342]: `#Off` belongs before a statement
  --> tests/ui/off_debug_attr_on_item.jet:1:1
    |
  1 | #Off
    | ^^^^
 Why: statement switch attributes control code inside a function body, not top-level declarations
 Fix: move it inside a function, e.g. `#Off print("debug")`, or remove it from the declaration
